{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a249257ea11c127b62bf7d3b4f4b14fdeb42bd16ad081890e5a43f5c8074e521",
      "text": "我这边自然没有任何理由阻拦。\n……不知负责人先生觉得如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3faa83ada1e8e0cc7aea764398ca3d275acfd07103b68953e09b6e82e3d1b8bf",
      "text": "太感谢了！\n请务必拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce7dcbc78f126328a60e8140f6aa1df449f9730681984c5d7af8f5ba9df30f9",
      "text": "那就这么定下来了。具体能做些什么，\n大家一起来集思广益吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000040:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d7f92e387840355ca9d57afcc932ef31b822f78e5af16176d2e5539c676b26e",
      "text": "出了好多点子呢。制作宣传海报、\n在脱口秀环节介绍工艺品……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bedb3d23715ddec46db0383e28f2e35421838138093d7f81410fc25dafaee28",
      "text": "我刚想到一个主意，工艺品的语音解说，\n交给我们来配音如何呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2460ea3783cc7f30a2ef65b7855532d5258cd27aa1a4e981102a5fb39a29435f",
      "text": "语音解说，是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c108717f7e7405829b087952b231466da6570df18be51358fe8d6c425992f55",
      "text": "对呀，就是语音导览嘛。\n在美术馆和博物馆里经常见到的那种，懂吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:052ca5735a4766c83388415566779a03e931275a2a584e6941381efa646ec9ad",
      "text": "原来喵此！由在下们来进行解说，\n既能让大家了解工艺品的精妙，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c507741e22f7c8c20ec9fdc812328a6cb00c9ce7de66bb348aa971d7c4405e6e",
      "text": "又能激发起大家的兴趣喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69ac34b582dd1d2a33df46b5e3240d41d044e8f47c7e4bd34e5ba0c548422907",
      "text": "好主意啊……！如果能结合各位的专业知识，\n一定会是一份极其精彩的解说！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43413dbc24ee3415bf153650611fa6673997f1dcd2ce621670fd372c5607a3ab",
      "text": "那个……虽然很不好意思，但我不得不说……\n……要想实现这个可能有些困难。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
